# Two GNSS receivers (both MAVLink GPS_INPUT here), only GPS1 spoofed in the test.
# EK3_AFFINITY 1: each EKF3 lane uses its own GPS (lane 0 => GPS1, lane 1 => GPS2); the
# primary lane is chosen on innovation error score. Two IMU lanes are required.
GPS2_TYPE 14
GPS2_DELAY_MS 1
EK3_IMU_MASK 3
EK3_AFFINITY 1
GPS_AUTO_SWITCH 1
